{"event": "agent_result", "task": "single-agent", "role": "single_agent", "result": {"report": {"incident_id": "airtable-expiry-041", "outcome": "probable_cause", "hypotheses": [{"description": "Observed Cedar failures are caused by users completing an Airtable authentication initiation after its 10-minute validity window, so the executor rejects the link before any token exchange.", "supporting_evidence": ["ev_7b13e68f1976", "ev_1c7dfb78223e", "ev_a964fad6c294", "ev_65a1711cc8ff"], "contradicting_evidence": [], "confidence": "high", "assumptions": ["The sampled Cedar 410 reflects the dominant failure mode behind the Cedar spike during the incident window.", "The public Airtable auth-window behavior in knowledge applies to this executor flow."]}, {"description": "A provider-side Airtable outage caused the failures.", "supporting_evidence": ["ev_e6be6f9b156c"], "contradicting_evidence": ["ev_7b13e68f1976", "ev_a964fad6c294", "ev_65a1711cc8ff"], "confidence": "low", "assumptions": ["Historical similarity would need current corroboration, which is not present here."]}, {"description": "A recent internal tool-executor deployment/regression caused late-arrival authentication failures.", "supporting_evidence": [], "contradicting_evidence": ["ev_a68c25a2f035", "ev_480d8997b003", "ev_a964fad6c294"], "confidence": "low", "assumptions": ["Absence of a tool-executor deployment in the queried window reduces, but does not mathematically eliminate, older latent regressions."]}], "recommended_actions": ["Start a fresh Airtable authentication initiation for affected users and have them complete it within the valid window; do not retry expired links.", "Update user-facing onboarding/copy to warn that old Airtable auth links expire after 10 minutes and require regeneration.", "Add monitoring/alerting for elevated EXPIRED initiation states and age-over-window auth completions in Cedar-like onboarding funnels.", "Collect product telemetry on auth-link generation vs completion timing to quantify how much of Cedar's onboarding drop is explained by late arrivals."], "limitations": ["Metrics queries initially timed out before succeeding, so telemetry coverage is limited to the returned sample points.", "Connections and refresh-history queries returned no records, which does not prove broader absence of other auth issues.", "No direct onboarding funnel telemetry or user-level samples were provided beyond the observed executor records."]}, "ranked_cause_codes": ["authentication_initiation_expired", "provider_failure", "unconfirmed_change"], "findings": [{"code": "mechanism_observation", "statement": "The failed Cedar request was rejected in EXPIRED connection state with initiation_age_seconds 950 exceeding completion_window_seconds 600, and no token exchange was attempted.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_7b13e68f1976", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:logs:0"}]}, {"code": "pre_provider_failure", "statement": "Because token_exchange_attempted=false on the failed Cedar auth completion, the observed failure happened before any provider token exchange rather than during a provider-side API call.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_7b13e68f1976", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:logs:0"}]}, {"code": "controlled_comparison", "statement": "In the controlled sandbox comparison, the original Airtable configuration failed with the same EXPIRED state at age 950/600, while the corrected condition succeeded at age 120/600 and became ACTIVE.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_a964fad6c294", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:reproduce:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_a964fad6c294", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:reproduce:1"}]}, {"code": "tenant_impact", "statement": "Impact was concentrated in Cedar: 390 failures out of 636 requests with 390 business operations blocked, queue_depth 114, and p95 latency 1520 ms, while Maple had 0 failures out of 538 requests, 0 blocked operations, queue_depth 0, and p95 latency 160 ms.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_65a1711cc8ff", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:metrics:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_65a1711cc8ff", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:metrics:1"}]}, {"code": "provider_isolation", "statement": "Same-provider activity was observed as healthy elsewhere during the incident: Maple had a 200 response with same_provider_available=true and unrelated_read_succeeds=true, arguing against a broad Airtable outage.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_7b13e68f1976", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:logs:1"}]}, {"code": "verification_control", "statement": "Public reference material matches the observed mechanism: unfinished Airtable connection initiation expires after its allowed ten-minute window.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_1c7dfb78223e", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:knowledge:0"}]}], "action_codes": ["authentication_initiation_expired_remediation", "monitor_provider", "collect_missing_telemetry"]}}
